       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TCNMAINT.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   TCNMAINT            CHANGE NOTICE AUTHORIZATION FILE    *
      *                                                            *
      *D    THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO ADD, MODIFY, AND DELETE        *
      *D    RECORDS IN THE MCFPCSAUTH FILE WHICH IS USED TO        *
      *D    ALLOW USERS TO ACCESS PRICE INFORMATION ON PURCHASE    *
      *D    ORDER CHANGE NOTICES (MENU OPTION 'CN').               *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT AUTH-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSAUTH
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZCNOTICE-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  AUTH-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  AF-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCSAUTH.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC              PIC X(2000).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  AUTH-REC.
           05  AUTH-USER            PIC X(10).
           05  AUTH-PRICE-SW        PIC X.
           05  FILLER               PIC X(09).

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1        PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2        PIC X VALUE SPACE.

       01  SUB                      PIC 99     VALUE 0.

       01  BASE                     PIC X(10)  VALUE "  STORES;".

       01  PROG-SWITCHES.
           05  ERROR-FOUND          PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".
           05  AUTH-EOF-SW          PIC X(1)   VALUE "N".

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT             PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD              PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.

       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
      *                     I N P U T   S C R E E N                    *
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       01  OPT-SCREEN.
           05  OPT-OPTION           PIC X.
           05  OPT-INFO-LINE        PIC X(74).
           05  OPT-MSGLINE          PIC X(80).

       01  SCREEN-AUTH.
           05  SC-FUNCTION          PIC X(23).
           05  SC-FIELDS.
               10  SC-USER          PIC X(10).
               10  SC-PRICE-SW      PIC X.
           05  SC-INFO-LINE         PIC X(74).
           05  SC-MSGLINE           PIC X(80).

       COPY TBLOWUP      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA     IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMAREA     IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE     IN COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N            *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       0-BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "TCNMAINT" TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.


       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *               B L O W U P   R O U T I N E                 *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *                 M A I N   P A R A G R A P H               *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "OPTION"       TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACE          TO OPT-OPTION.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "TYPE IN THE APPROPRIATE OPTION AND PRESS THE ENTER KEY"
                               TO OPT-INFO-LINE.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE OPT-SCREEN     TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO OPT-SCREEN.

           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-CONT.
           IF OPT-OPTION = "A"
               OPEN I-O AUTH-FILE
               PERFORM 60-ADD-RECORD THRU 60-EXIT
               CLOSE AUTH-FILE
           ELSE
           IF OPT-OPTION = "C"
               OPEN I-O AUTH-FILE
               PERFORM 61-CHANGE-RECORD THRU 61-EXIT
               CLOSE AUTH-FILE
           ELSE
           IF OPT-OPTION = "D"
               OPEN I-O AUTH-FILE
               PERFORM 62-DELETE-RECORD THRU 62-EXIT.
               CLOSE AUTH-FILE
           GO TO 6-MAIN.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *               A D D   A   R E C O R D                     *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       60-ADD-RECORD.
           MOVE "FCUSERMN"     TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           MOVE " ADD AN AUTHORIZED USER"  TO SC-FUNCTION.
           MOVE "N"            TO SC-PRICE-SW.

       60-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "ENTER THE DATA ABOVE AND PRESS THE ENTER KEY TO ADD A U
      -         "SER     "     TO SC-INFO-LINE.

       60-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-AUTH   TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 60-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               GO TO 60-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE SPACES             TO  AUTH-REC.
           MOVE SC-USER            TO  AUTH-USER.
           MOVE SC-PRICE-SW        TO  AUTH-PRICE-SW.
           WRITE AF-REC FROM AUTH-REC
               INVALID KEY    MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
             MOVE "PROBLEM WITH ADDING USER--CONTACT PROGRAMMING STAFF"
                                   TO  OPT-MSGLINE
           ELSE
               MOVE "** USER WAS ADDED **"  TO  OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE SPACES         TO  SC-FIELDS.
           MOVE B"1"               TO  IND(99).
           GO TO 60-EXIT.

       60-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *              C H A N G E   A   R E C O R D                *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       61-CHANGE-RECORD.
           MOVE "FCUSERMN"     TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           MOVE "CHANGE AUTHORIZED USER "  TO SC-FUNCTION.
           MOVE "N"            TO AUTH-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM 61-READ-FILE.

       61-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT USER OR MAKE CHANGES AND PRESS
      -        " F7"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-AUTH    TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 61-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"       TO IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ CANNOT PRESS ENTER KEY.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 0
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-CONTINUE.
      *------ DISPLAY NEXT RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 4
               IF AUTH-EOF-SW NOT = "Y"
                   PERFORM 61-READ-FILE
                   MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT USER OR MAKE CHANGES A
      -                     "ND PRESS F7"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE
               END-IF
      *---------- IF END OF FILE, RESTART LIST
               IF AUTH-EOF-SW = "Y"
                   GO TO 61-EXIT
               ELSE
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ CHANGE RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 7
               MOVE SC-USER     TO AUTH-USER
               MOVE SC-PRICE-SW TO AUTH-PRICE-SW
               REWRITE AF-REC FROM AUTH-REC
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "++ PROBLEM WITH WRITE--CONTACT PROGRAMMER ++"
                                TO OPT-MSGLINE
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES  TO SC-FIELDS
                                   AUTH-REC
                   MOVE "** USER CHANGED **" TO OPT-MSGLINE
               END-IF
               MOVE B"1"    TO IND(99)
               GO TO 61-EXIT
           END-IF.

       61-READ-FILE.
           READ AUTH-FILE NEXT INTO AUTH-REC
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO AUTH-EOF-SW.
           IF AUTH-EOF-SW = "N"
               MOVE AUTH-USER      TO  SC-USER
               MOVE AUTH-PRICE-SW  TO  SC-PRICE-SW.
       61-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------*
      *              D E L E T E   A   R E C O R D                *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------*

       62-DELETE-RECORD.
           MOVE "FCUSERMN"     TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           MOVE "DELETE AUTHORIED USER  "  TO SC-FUNCTION.
      *------ SEE IF ANY RECORDS EXIST IN THE FILE.
           MOVE "N"             TO AUTH-EOF-SW.
           PERFORM 62-READ-FILE.
           IF AUTH-EOF-SW = "Y"
               MOVE "NO USERS TO DISPLAY OR DELETE"
                                TO  OPT-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1"        TO  IND(99)
               GO TO 62-EXIT.

       62-PUT-BUFFER.
           MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT USER OR PRESS F6 TO DELETE"
                                TO SC-INFO-LINE.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE SCREEN-AUTH     TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC     TO SCREEN-AUTH.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 62-EXIT.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO SC-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ CANNOT PRESS ENTER KEY.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 0
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-CONTINUE.
      *------ DISPLAY NEXT RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 4
               IF AUTH-EOF-SW NOT = "Y"
                   PERFORM 62-READ-FILE
                   MOVE "PRESS F4 TO SEE THE NEXT USER OR PRESS F6 TO DE
      -                     "LETE"  TO  SC-INFO-LINE
               END-IF
      *------ IF END OF FILE, OFFER OPTION TO RESTART LIST.
               IF AUTH-EOF-SW = "Y"
                   GO TO 62-EXIT
               ELSE
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

      *------ DELETE RECORD.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 6
               DELETE AUTH-FILE
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "++ PROBLEM WITH DELETE--CONTACT PROGRAMMER ++"
                                TO OPT-MSGLINE
               ELSE
                   MOVE SPACES  TO SC-FIELDS
                                   AUTH-REC
                   MOVE "** USER DELETED **" TO OPT-MSGLINE
               END-IF
               MOVE B"1"    TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-EXIT
           END-IF.

       62-READ-FILE.
           READ AUTH-FILE NEXT INTO AUTH-REC
               AT END MOVE "Y" TO AUTH-EOF-SW.
           IF AUTH-EOF-SW = "N"
               MOVE AUTH-USER      TO  SC-USER
               MOVE AUTH-PRICE-SW  TO  SC-PRICE-SW.

       62-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
